      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Episode IX: Adding the weird instructions `LUI`, `AUIPC`, `JAL`, `JALR`",
      "source_hash": 3462670535985207698,
      "context_hash": 5742187602800108197,
      "translation": "9화: 이상한 명령어 `LUI`, `AUIPC`, `JAL`, `JALR` 추가하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:39.817966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/FemtoRV32_design_4.jpg)",
