      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "In fact, these instructions are not that complicated.",
      "source_hash": 12715123727743858740,
      "context_hash": 18380337126813436692,
      "translation": "사실 이 명령어들은 그렇게 복잡하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:39.817966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Let us see again what they are supposed to do:",
      "source_hash": 14858364198659468840,
      "context_hash": 5631888437777757142,
      "translation": "이들이 무엇을 해야 하는지 다시 살펴봅시다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:39.817966Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
